# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root-level organizational enforcement (Cleanup Phase 1, 2026-04-20)
# See docs/cleanup/ROOT_CLEANUP_PLAN.md for the reasoning.
#
# *.log and nohup*.out are already globally ignored above — these root-level
# rules are documentation for future maintainers. If a log appears at root
# instead of logs/, it's a mistake; send it to logs/.
#
# PNGs at root are blocked so image artifacts from ad-hoc tests don't land
# in the git-tracked set — put them under tests/artifacts/ or media/ instead.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Keep image artifacts out of the repo root
/*.png

# Truth propagation phase artifacts
coverage-*.json
verify-report.json
behavior-*.json

